{
  "info": {
    "name": "IntelliQE - REST APIs by Authentication Type",
    "_postman_id": "b7f5484c-f1f1-434f-a47f-c4269cfd7cef",
    "description": "30 real, public REST APIs organised into 12 folders by authentication type - No Auth, API Key (query + header), Bearer, Basic, Digest, OAuth 1.0, OAuth 2.0 (client-credentials + auth-code), JWT, Hawk and AWS SigV4.\n\nHOW TO USE\n- API Studio: Import panel -> Postman Collection -> upload this file. Requests load into the catalogue.\n- Flow builder: import to get runnable steps; bearer/basic/apikey/oauth2 auth carry over automatically.\n- Fill the collection variables below for the 'free signup' / 'sandbox' APIs. 15 requests run immediately with the credentials already baked in.\n\nVerified 2026-11-04.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
